    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Galvin Property are delighted to present Carrigmore, a spacious three-bedroom detached bungalow and garage occupying a mature and private setting on Killiney Road. The property offers generously proportioned accommodation throughout and represents an excellent opportunity for a purchaser seeking a home that can be upgraded and modernised to their own taste. \r\n\r\nWith bright living accommodation, three well-sized bedrooms and substantial gardens, Carrigmore offers considerable potential on one of South Dublin’s most prestigious roads. The accommodation is arranged around a central hallway and includes an exceptionally spacious reception room, which benefits from large picture windows providing excellent natural light and pleasant views over the surrounding gardens. The room provides ample space for both living and dining areas and features a fireplace. The kitchen is also particularly generous in size, with extensive fitted storage and direct access towards the rear of the property. While requiring modernisation, its proportions provide an excellent basis for the creation of a contemporary kitchen and dining space. There are three bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom with built-in storage, together with two further well-proportioned rooms offering flexibility for bedroom, home office or study use. A family bathroom completes the internal accommodation. \r\n\r\nExternally, the property is complemented by mature gardens which provide a wonderful sense of privacy and seclusion. The generous outdoor space, \r\ntogether with the existing footprint of the bungalow, offers excellent potential for a purchaser looking to enhance or extend with existing planning permission in place (D25A/0961/WEB) allowing for conversion of the existing garage, kitchen extension, new entrance porch to the front and new pedestrian gate access. This permission adds c.42 sq mts of living space to the property. \r\n\r\nCarrigmore enjoys a superb location on Killiney Road and sits on a substantial and superbly orientated plot offering a buyer a blank canvas to create a substantial family home in a super location and within walking distance of Dalkey, Sandycove, Glasthule and Killiney. The area is well served by local amenities, schools, recreational facilities and transport connections, while Dalkey offers an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and everyday services. Carrigmore presents a rare opportunity to acquire a detached home of generous proportions in this established and highly regarded location, with significant scope to create a superb family home.\r\n\r\nThis property needs to be viewed, call us now on 014964612 to arrange a viewing."
      },
